<title>USA: Livestock/meat crossings at U.S./Canadian border.</title>
<headline>Livestock/meat crossings at U.S./Canadian border.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Canada reported the following preliminary livestock and meat crossings at the U.S./Canadian border. - USDA</p>
<p>Canadian Imports from the U.S.		:  yr to   yr ago</p>
<p>		    02/01/97 01/25/97 02/03/96:  date    to date</p>
<p>Livestock/in head</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:    15	   2     19 :     225	 752</p>
<p>Heifers:		 12	   0     11 :     176	 142</p>
<p>Cows:		 1,131	 804    392 :   4,242     2,095</p>
<p>Bulls:		   38	  32	5 :     181	  35</p>
<p>Totals		1,196	 838    427 :   4,824     3,024</p>
<p>Canadian Imports from the U.S. - Meat (1,000 lbs):</p>
<p>     PERIOD    PREVIOUS    LAST     1997	SAME     YTD</p>
<p>     ENDING    WEEK	  YEAR    YEAR TO   PERIOD   PERCENT</p>
<p>     02/01/97  01/25/97  02/03/96   DATE     LAST YR   CHANGE</p>
<p>Beef  4,096     4,837     4,273 :  17,546    21,263  -  17.5%</p>
<p>Pork  1,429     1,162     1,958 :   6,164     7,284  -  15.4%</p>
<p>Canadian Exports into the U.S. - Meat (1,000 lbs):</p>
<p>	PERIOD    PREVIOUS    LAST    1997	SAME	YTD</p>
<p>	ENDING    WEEK	  YEAR    TO	 PERIOD   PERCENT</p>
<p>Meat  02/01/97  01/25/97  02/03/96  DATE     LAST YR   CHANGE</p>
<p>Beef     254     3,620     1,440 :  3,873     3,748  +  3.4%</p>
<p>Pork     410     1,526     1,162 :  1,936     3,657  - 47.1%</p>
<p>*Year to date totals may reflect revisions from previous weeks Source: Agriculture Canada.</p>
